ent-ClothingEyesGlassesJanitor = janitorial scanner goggles
    .desc = Highlights loose trash in orange and puddles in blue through walls within eight metres. Wear them over your eyes and use the scanner action to toggle detection.
ent-ActionToggleJanitorVision = Toggle janitorial scanner
    .desc = Highlights nearby loose trash and puddles through walls. Orange crosses mark trash; blue circles mark puddles.
